# Axiom Development Rules
# Reference: MASTER_PROJECT_PLAN.md (§14-16)

# ── TDD ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Follow Red-Green-Refactor for all backend code (superpowers_tdd.md).
# No production code without a failing test first.

# ── Backend ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Framework: FastAPI + Pydantic V2 + SQLAlchemy + Alembic.
# main.py is a slim app factory — no business logic.
# New endpoints go in src/backend/api/v1/ with versioned prefix.
# All errors use structured format from core/exceptions.py.
# Config via core/config.py (Pydantic Settings), not os.getenv().
# Run: uv run uvicorn src.backend.main:app --reload

# ── Frontend ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Framework: Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, Tailwind CSS v4, Shadcn UI.
# Design: B2B Enterprise aesthetic (Plus Jakarta Sans, Electric Blue accents).
# API calls go through src/frontend/src/lib/api.ts — never raw fetch().
# Components use (marketing)/_sections/ pattern for landing page sections.

# ── Git ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Conventional Commits: feat(scope): description
# Branch: feat/name, bugfix/name, docs/name
# Pre-commit hooks: Prettier + ESLint via Husky.

# ── Docs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Source of truth: MASTER_PROJECT_PLAN.md
# All documentation in English.
